KG42.register("source_edge_archive-6fd2e415e910d6ea1a6934c6",{"id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E004","paper":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding","rule_id":"v141-c-R005","rule_ref":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R005","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R005-E004","source":"pricing.local","target":"coordination.price_signal","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R005-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g04-E04"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R005-C002"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG31-69ba805a251afd65","target":"KG31-b4fad0e41a945d4f","source_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R005::V::pricing.local","target_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R005::V::coordination.price_signal","source_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::pricing.local","target_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::coordination.price_signal","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"coordination","context_text":"Customers' decentralized ZIP price decisions during the CDA Agreement Period. | ZIP price decisions for bids and asks remaining in the order book for time slot t. | ZIP revisions of ask prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. | ZIP revisions of bid prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E15","v141-b-g04-E04"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"c62400e128e244f9be31411bdb350efa37ee2b2767b5b238cc7552bfa4a6f3a7","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01-p2p-cda","source_definition":"After counterparties are matched under strategy one, each pair price equals the arithmetic mean of the corresponding offered and bid prices. Pair prices are independent of other transactions. Similar algebra at k=0.5 does not equate the full mechanism to discriminatory k-double auction.","target_definition":"Results of preceding bid/ask matching provide feedback for customers' ZIP bid/ask price adjustments. Scope: Customers' decentralized ZIP price decisions during the CDA Agreement Period. The successful CDA trading price provides the comparison reference for customers' subsequent ZIP bid/ask price decisions. Scope: ZIP price decisions for bids and asks remaining in the order book for time slot t. Condition: The last CDA matching was successfully made at price π_t. In this successful-matching branch, arrival of an ask conditions the downward ZIP revision of an eligible bid price toward the feed-in tariff reference. Scope: ZIP revisions of bid prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. Condition: The last matching was successful and π_{b,t} \u003c= π_t at the corresponding test in the update sequence. In the unsuccessful-matching branch, arrival of an ask conditions downward ZIP revisions of ask prices toward the feed-in tariff reference. Scope: ZIP revisions of ask prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. Condition: The last matching was unsuccessful. In this successful-matching branch, arrival of a bid conditions the downward ZIP revision of an eligible ask price toward the feed-in tariff reference. Scope: ZIP revisions of ask prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. Condition: The last matching was successful and π_{s,t} >= π_t at the corresponding test in the update sequence. In the unsuccessful-matching branch, arrival of a bid conditions downward ZIP revisions of bid prices toward the feed-in tariff reference. Scope: ZIP revisions of bid prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. Condition: The last matching was unsuccessful.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R005-C002","kind":"procedural","role":"core","statement":"The successful CDA trading price provides the comparison reference for customers' subsequent ZIP bid/ask price decisions. Scope: ZIP price decisions for bids and asks remaining in the order book for time slot t. Condition: The last CDA matching was successfully made at price π_t.","expression":null,"formalization_origin":"not_formalized","template_id":null,"members":["pricing.local","coordination.price_signal"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g04-E04"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g04-E04","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p15-c1r2__v141-a-M01-bidding","page":15,"printed_page":null,"section":"Appendix B","anchor_text":"Appendix B The bidding process of customers in the continuous double auction (CDA) The bidding proce","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-15.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"The bidding process of customers in the CDA process\n1: while the current time is within the Agreement Period for CDA\n2: if a bid/ask associated with the time slot t arrives at the exchange\n3: run the CDA process as shown in Appendix A;\n4: for any bid o_{b,t} in the order book t\n5: if the last matching was successfully made at the price π_t\n6: if π_{b,t} >= π_t\n7: π_{b,t} = π_{b,t} + γ·(p^{retail}_t - π_{b,t});\n8: end if\n9: if it is an ask that arrived\n10: if π_{b,t} \u003c= π_t\n11: π_{b,t} = π_{b,t} - γ·(π_{b,t} - p^{FiT}_t);\n12: end if\n13: end if\n14: else\n15: if it is a bid that arrived\n16: π_{b,t} = π_{b,t} - γ·(π_{b,t} - p^{FiT}_t);\n17: end if\n18: end if\n19: end for\n20: for any ask o_{s,t} in the order book t\n21: if the last matching was successfully made at the price π_t\n22: if π_{s,t} \u003c= π_t\n23: π_{s,t} = π_{s,t} + γ·(p^{retail}_t - π_{s,t});\n24: end if\n25: if it is a bid that arrived\n26: if π_{s,t} >= π_t\n27: π_{s,t} = π_{s,t} - γ·(π_{s,t} - p^{FiT}_t);\n28: end if\n29: end if\n30: else\n31: if it is an ask that arrived\n32: π_{s,t} = π_{s,t} - γ·(π_{s,t} - p^{FiT}_t);\n33: end if\n34: end if\n35: end for\n36: end if\n37: end while\nNote that γ is the coefficient for customers to update their bid/ask prices, and its value within (0, 1)."}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"coordination","context_text":"Customers' decentralized ZIP price decisions during the CDA Agreement Period. | ZIP price decisions for bids and asks remaining in the order book for time slot t. | ZIP revisions of ask prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period. | ZIP revisions of bid prices in order book t during the CDA Agreement Period.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E15","v141-b-g04-E04"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R005-E004","source":"pricing.local","target":"coordination.price_signal","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R005-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g04-E04"]},"paper_scope_note":"CDA, ancillary services, and residual agreement adjustment are kept separate; arrival events, matched orders, and the next ZIP update are not variables at the same time point; reward and compensation costs are different settlement sub-items."}});
